Dashboard (Home module)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The board design (banner, sections and widgets persisted as Markdown) derives
from apex-dashboard and from obsidian-dashboard.

apex-dashboard
https://github.com/PandoraReads/apex-dashboard
Current dashboard layout, themes, interactions, sections, widgets, statistics,
RSS, service integrations and backup behavior are adapted from commit
ac4d2c745d950b9c4d53d3fd33388204b0769841 (v3.8.4), in home/ui, home/core
and home/services. The following historical references retain commit
db9d2892032c27f5f8899a72c0dca61d72572a9a (v3.7.5):
- home/core/board/board-codec.ts: coarse-height conversion;
- home/core/board/focal-point.ts: focal-point format and crop semantics;
- home/core/board/immersive-grid.ts: placement behavior reference.
Source and behavior mappings: docs/third-party/apex-dashboard.md.

