Notes navigator (Navigator module)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The two-pane notes navigator (src/modules/navigator) models its behavior on the
public documentation and observable behavior of Notebook Navigator.

Notebook Navigator
https://github.com/johansan/notebook-navigator
Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.
Only behavior was referenced (pane structure, keyboard table, search filter
syntax, calendar and periodic notes, template tokens, create-note commands,
vault profiles, merge notes and tag operations). No source code, comments or
style text of Notebook Navigator is included in HUHU; the module is an
independent implementation in HUHU's architecture and remains MIT licensed.
Reference scope: docs/third-party/notebook-navigator.md.

