Skills manager (Agent module)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The skills page in the agent settings (src/modules/agent: core/skills/library.ts,
platform/desktop/skills, services/skill-manager.ts, ui/settings/SkillsSection.tsx)
adapts the discovery, content hashing, copy-to-tool and card/toggle behavior of
skills-manager.

skills-manager
https://github.com/xingkongliang/skills-manager
Adapted from commit 7f92c21882456f6b801884818dd898d19bc20ff9. Only discovery,
per-agent enable/disable by copying, and the card layout are used; the market,
Git install, update check and grouping features are not.
Source and behavior mappings: docs/third-party/skills-manager.md.

