--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

https://github.com/sulistef/obsidian-suliworld
Copyright (c) 2026 Stéphane Sulikowski
Licensed under the MIT License.

The SuliWorld interface and editor styles in src/theme/styles adapt src/theme.css
from commit bb73ca60dbc1169eb8d4c81fefb0c721ff7faf42: Cream and Forest surfaces,
dark mode, desktop cards, typography, headings, quotes, callouts, code, embeds,
tables and controls. HUHU adds scoped opt-in classes, semantic tokens, contrast
adjustments and Chinese font fallbacks; special task-state semantics are not
ported. Source and behavior mapping: docs/third-party/suliworld.md.
